Thu May 21 2026 Michael Jansen <ferroclass@michael-jansen.biz> - 0.11.0-2

- Add %debug_package for proper binary stripping and debuginfo packages
- Escape %license macro in comment to fix rpmlint warning

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu May 21 2026 Michael Jansen <ferroclass@michael-jansen.biz> - 0.11.0-1

- Tighten public API surface: internal modules are now pub(crate)
- Add crate-root re-exports for commonly used types
- Add API documentation (module-level and item-level doc comments)
- Add make doc and make docclean targets
- Restrict ExclusiveArch to x86_64 only (aarch64 snapshot tests
  are non-deterministic due to HashMap iteration order)
- Align spec with openSUSE and Fedora Rust packaging guidelines

